---@field BotName? aws.wafv2.FilterString Filters the results to include only traffic from the specified bot. For example, you can filter by gptbot or googlebot. When you apply this filter, the Source field is populated in the response.
---@field Limit aws.wafv2.PathStatisticsLimit The maximum number of path statistics to return. Valid values are 1 to 100.
