---@field ResponseCodeSent? aws.wafv2.ResponseStatusCode The response code that was sent for the request.
---@field Labels? aws.wafv2.Labels Labels applied to the web request by matching rules. WAF applies fully qualified labels to matching web requests. A fully qualified label is the concatenation of a label namespace and a rule label. The rule's rule group or web ACL defines the label namespace.
